details:
- Bluetooth: Fix use after free in hci_send_acl {CVE-2022-49111}
- NFSv4/pnfs: Fix a use-after-free bug in open {CVE-2022-50072}
- NFSv4: Don't hold the layoutget locks across multiple RPC calls {CVE-2022-50072}
- net: qrtr: start MHI channel after endpoit creation {CVE-2022-50044}
- tty: n_gsm: add sanity check for gsm->receive in gsm_receive_buf() {CVE-2022-49940}
- net: atlantic: fix aq_vec index out of range error {CVE-2022-50066}
- ndisc: use RCU protection in ndisc_alloc_skb() {CVE-2025-21764}
- udmabuf: fix a buf size overflow issue during udmabuf creation {CVE-2025-37803}
- mptcp: fix race on unaccepted mptcp sockets {CVE-2022-49669}
- net: introduce and use lock_sock_fast_nested() {CVE-2022-49669}
- net: add annotation for sock_{lock,unlock}_fast {CVE-2022-49669}
- net/mlx5: Always stop health timer during driver removal {CVE-2024-40906}
- nfsd: prevent panic for nfsv4.0 closed files in nfs4_show_open {CVE-2024-46682}
- nfsd: fix possible badness in FREE_STATEID {CVE-2024-50043}
- nfsd: fix race between laundromat and free_stateid {CVE-2024-50106}
- nfsd: split sc_status out of sc_type {CVE-2024-50106}
- nfsd: avoid race after unhash_delegation_locked() {CVE-2024-50106}
- nfsd: remove fault injection code {CVE-2024-50106}
- nfsd: don't call functions with side-effecting inside WARN_ON() {CVE-2024-50106}
- ath11k: free peer for station when disconnect from AP for QCA6390/WCN6855 {CVE-2022-49238}
- cifs: Fix UAF in cifs_demultiplex_thread() {CVE-2023-52572}
- xfrm: state: fix out-of-bounds read during lookup {CVE-2024-57982}
- drm/amdgpu: add missing size check in amdgpu_debugfs_gprwave_read() {CVE-2024-50282}
